{"id": "182101", "name": "טור מקלורן של √(a+bx) – ארבעה איברים ראשונים, טור בינומי (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Using the Binomial series result, find the first four non zero terms in the Maclaurin series for</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\sqrt{({{CT:0}}+{{CT:1}}x)} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Take out the constant so that the binomial series of \\((1+x)^{1/2}\\) applies, then expand.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Taking out the constant</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\sqrt{({{CT:0}}+{{CT:1}}x)} \\]</p>can be written as<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\sqrt{{{CT:0}}} \\sqrt{(1+{{CT:2}})}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — The binomial series</b><br>As<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {(1+x)}^{1/2} = 1 +\\frac{1}{2} x + \\frac{(1/2)(1/2-1)}{2 !} x^2 +\\frac{(1/2)(1/2 -1)(1/2 - 2)}{3 ! } x^3 + \\ldots , \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {(1+ {{CT:3}} )}^{1/2} = 1 +\\frac{1}{2} {{CT:3}} + \\frac{(1/2)(1/2-1)}{2 !} ({{CT:3}} )^2 +\\frac{(1/2)(1/2 -1)(1/2 - 2)}{3 ! } ({{CT:3}} )^3 + \\ldots . \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — The first four terms</b><br>Hence<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\sqrt{({{CT:0}}+{{CT:1}}x)} = \\sqrt{{{CT:0}}} (1 + {{CT:4}} - {{CT:5}} + {{CT:6}} + \\ldots) \\]</p>or<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\sqrt{({{CT:0}}+{{CT:1}}x)} = {{CT:7}}+\\ldots \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">[[feedback:Result]]</span></p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 40, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "diff,taylor,sum,solve", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 